WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
President Donald Trump: My fellow
Americans: Tonight, I want to

2
00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.207
speak with you about our
nation's unprecedented response

3
00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:11.745
to the coronavirus outbreak that
started in China and is now

4
00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.180
spreading throughout the world.

5
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.350
Today, the World Health
Organization officially

6
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.254
announced that this
is a global pandemic.

7
00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:24.324
We have been in frequent contact
with our allies, and we are

8
00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.560
marshalling the full power of
the federal government and the

9
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.498
private sector to protect
the American people.

10
00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:35.001
This is the most aggressive and
comprehensive effort to confront

11
00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:37.771
a foreign virus
in modern history.

12
00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:42.409
I am confident that by counting
and continuing to take these

13
00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:46.212
tough measures, we will
significantly reduce the threat

14
00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.916
to our citizens, and we will
ultimately and expeditiously

15
00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.818
defeat this virus.

16
00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:55.021
From the beginning of time,
nations and people have faced

17
00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:59.893
unforeseen challenges, including
large-scale and very dangerous

18
00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.528
health threats.

19
00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:06.032
This is the way it always
was and always will be.

20
00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:10.170
It only matters how you respond,
and we are responding with great

21
00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.372
speed and professionalism.

22
00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.874
Our team is the best
anywhere in the world.

23
00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:18.711
At the very start of the
outbreak, we instituted sweeping

24
00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:23.283
travel restrictions on China and
put in place the first federally

25
00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:27.053
mandated quarantine
in over 50 years.

26
00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:31.224
We declared a public health
emergency and issued the highest

27
00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:36.496
level of travel warning on other
countries as the virus spread

28
00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:39.098
its horrible infection.

29
00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:43.803
And taking early intense action,
we have seen dramatically fewer

30
00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:47.240
cases of the virus in the
United States than are now

31
00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.976
present in Europe.

32
00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:53.313
The European Union failed to
take the same precautions and

33
00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:56.916
restrict travel from
China and other hotspots.

34
00:01:56.916 --> 00:02:00.487
As a result, a large number
of new clusters in the United

35
00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:04.557
States were seeded by
travelers from Europe.

36
00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:08.094
After consulting with our top
government health professionals,

37
00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:11.631
I have decided to take several
strong but necessary actions to

38
00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:16.035
protect the health and
wellbeing of all Americans.

39
00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:19.739
To keep new cases from entering
our shores, we will be

40
00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:23.610
suspending all travel from
Europe to the United States for

41
00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.712
the next 30 days.

42
00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:29.549
The new rules will go into
effect Friday at midnight.

43
00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:32.852
These restrictions will be
adjusted subject to conditions

44
00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.187
on the ground.

45
00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:37.257
There will be exemptions for
Americans who have undergone

46
00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:41.160
appropriate screenings, and
these prohibitions will not only

47
00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:45.798
apply to the tremendous amount
of trade and cargo, but various

48
00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:48.835
other things as we get approval.

49
00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:52.539
Anything coming from Europe
to the United States is what

50
00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.606
we are discussing.

51
00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:58.378
These restrictions will also not
apply to the United Kingdom.

52
00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:01.414
At the same time, we are
monitoring the situation in

53
00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.650
China and in South Korea.

54
00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:07.820
And, as their situation
improves, we will reevaluate the

55
00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.724
restrictions and warnings that
are currently in place for a

56
00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:14.427
possible early opening.

57
00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:18.131
Earlier this week, I met with
the leaders of health insurance

58
00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:23.002
industry who have agreed to
waive all copayments for

59
00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:27.240
coronavirus treatments, extend
insurance coverage to these

60
00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:31.210
treatments, and to prevent
surprise medical billing.

61
00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:34.847
We are cutting massive amounts
of red tape to make antiviral

62
00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:37.784
therapies available
in record time.

63
00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:41.254
These treatments will
significantly reduce the impact

64
00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:43.723
and reach of the virus.

65
00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:48.294
Additionally, last week, I
signed into law an $8.3 billion

66
00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:52.532
funding bill to help CDC and
other government agencies fight

67
00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:56.736
the virus and support vaccines,
treatments, and distribution of

68
00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.504
medical supplies.

69
00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:03.843
Testing and testing capabilities
are expanding rapidly,

70
00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:04.844
day by day.

71
00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:07.046
We are moving very quickly.

72
00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:13.219
The vast majority of Americans:
The risk is very, very low.

73
00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:16.222
Young and healthy people can
expect to recover fully and

74
00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:18.958
quickly if they
should get the virus.

75
00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:23.262
The highest risk is for elderly
population with underlying

76
00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:24.464
health conditions.

77
00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:29.369
The elderly population
must be very, very careful.

78
00:04:29.369 --> 00:04:32.572
In particular, we are strongly
advising that nursing homes for

79
00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:36.542
the elderly suspend all
medically unnecessary visits.

80
00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:40.680
In general, older Americans
should also avoid nonessential

81
00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.915
travel in crowded areas.

82
00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.785
My administration is
coordinating directly with

83
00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:50.256
communities with the largest
outbreaks, and we have issued

84
00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:54.794
guidance on school closures,
social distancing, and reducing

85
00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:56.529
large gatherings.

86
00:04:56.529 --> 00:05:00.466
Smart action today will
prevent the spread

87
00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:02.835
of the virus tomorrow.

88
00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:06.939
Every community faces different
risks and it is critical for you

89
00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:10.376
to follow the guidelines of your
local officials who are working

90
00:05:10.376 --> 00:05:13.146
