health experts --

91
00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:14.681
and they are the best.

92
00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:17.450
For all Americans, it is
essential that everyone take

93
00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:21.454
extra precautions and
practice good hygiene.

94
00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:25.358
Each of us has a role to
play in defeating this virus.

95
00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:29.996
Wash your hands, clean
often-used surfaces, cover your

96
00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:34.667
