cough, and most of all, if you

97
00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:38.604
are sick or not feeling
well, stay home.

98
00:05:38.604 --> 00:05:42.475
To ensure that working Americans
impacted by the virus can stay

99
00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:46.145
home without fear of financial
hardship, I will soon be taking

100
00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:50.116
emergency action, which is
unprecedented, to provide

101
00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:51.751
financial relief.

102
00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:54.854
This will be targeted
for workers who are ill,

103
00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:59.392
quarantined, or caring for
others due to coronavirus.

104
00:05:59.392 --> 00:06:03.196
I will be asking Congress to
take legislative action to

105
00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:05.364
extend this relief.

106
00:06:05.364 --> 00:06:09.802
Because of the economic policies
that we have put into place over

107
00:06:09.802 --> 00:06:14.407
the last three years, we have
the greatest economy anywhere

108
00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:16.476
in the world, by far.

109
00:06:16.476 --> 00:06:19.112
Our banks and financial
institutions are fully

110
00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:22.281
capitalized and
incredibly strong.

111
00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:25.518
Our unemployment is
at a historic low.

112
00:06:25.518 --> 00:06:29.689
This vast economic prosperity
gives us flexibility, reserves,

113
00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:33.826
and resources to handle any
threat that comes our way.

114
00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:38.965
This is not a financial crisis,
this is just a temporary moment

115
00:06:38.965 --> 00:06:42.502
of time that we will overcome
together as a nation

116
00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:44.103
and as a world.

117
00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:47.306
However, to provide extra
support for American workers,

118
00:06:47.306 --> 00:06:50.743
families, and businesses,
tonight I am announcing the

119
00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:55.114
following additional actions:
I am instructing the Small

120
00:06:55.114 --> 00:06:59.218
Business Administration to
exercise available authority to

121
00:06:59.218 --> 00:07:01.988
provide capital and
liquidity to firms affected

122
00:07:01.988 --> 00:07:03.389
