additional $50 billion.

129
00:07:26.412 --> 00:07:31.584
Using emergency authority, I
will be instructing the Treasury

130
00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:35.087
Department to defer tax
payments, without interest or

131
00:07:35.087 --> 00:07:38.491
