133
00:07:40.459 --> 00:07:44.463
This action will provide more
than $200 billion of additional

134
00:07:44.463 --> 00:07:46.666
liquidity to the economy.

135
00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:49.602
Finally, I am calling on
Congress to provide Americans

136
00:07:49.602 --> 00:07:52.839
