payroll tax relief.

137
00:07:52.839 --> 00:07:56.409
Hopefully they will consider
this very strongly.

138
00:07:56.409 --> 00:08:01.447
We are at a critical time in
the fight against the virus.

139
00:08:01.447 --> 00:08:05.284
We made a life-saving move
