of the American people.

144
00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:22.568
I will always put the
wellbeing of America first.

145
00:08:22.568 --> 00:08:26.539
If we are vigilant -- and we can
reduce the chance of infection,

146
00:08:26.539 --> 00:08:30.309
which we will -- we will
significantly impede the

147
00:08:30.309 --> 00:08:33.646
