151
00:08:42.088 --> 00:08:45.691
We have the best economy, the
most advanced healthcare, and

152
00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:48.661
the most talented doctors,
scientists, and researchers

153
00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:50.763
