154
00:08:50.763 --> 00:08:54.000
We are all in this together.

155
00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:59.605
We must put politics aside, stop
the partisanship, and unify

156
00:08:59.605 --> 00:09:03.075
together as one
nation and one family.

157
00:09:03.075 --> 00:09:06.979
As history has proven time and
time again, Americans always

158
00:09:06.979 --> 00:09:10.383
rise to the challenge
and overcome adversity.

159
00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:14.020
Our future remains brighter
than anyone can imagine.

160
00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:18.457
Acting with compassion and love,
we will heal the sick, care for

161
00:09:18.457 --> 00:09:22.561
those in need, help our fellow
citizens, and emerge from this

162
00:09:22.561 --> 00:09:26.666
challenge stronger and more
unified than ever before.

163
00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:29.969
God bless you, and
God bless America.

164
00:09:29.969 --> 00:09:31.537
Thank you.
